"md5":"6add5b2c31612345d7a43bf1db816849","mtime":"1085445509","size":"12663212","crc32":"60e7309c","sha1":"4406dc11ea93cc17bd51913aac8cd83f24873f19","format":"WAVE","length":"143.57","height":"0","width":"0"},{"name":"lbj_wh6606_02_10214_carr_spectrogram.png","source":"derivative","format":"Spectrogram","original":"lbj_wh6606_02_10214_carr.wav","mtime":"1418143538","size":"257187","md5":"e38bb20712d301657c21a43e97ae638d","crc32":"54186a76","sha1":"6877e89c91607c57e60d41ad339e8db99dd475b2"}],"files_count":55,"item_last_updated":1547527560,"item_size":369426629,"metadata":{"mediatype":"audio","identifier":"lbj660602","type":"sound","publicdate":"2004-05-25 20:30:18","creator":"Lyndon B. Johnson","description":"Lyndon B. Johnson secret White House recording. Tape 2 of June 1966.","date":"1966-06-00 00:00:00","collection":["presidential_recordings","audio_news"],"title":"Lyndon B. Johnson Recording 6606.2; June 1966, Tape 2","uploader":"michaeldgreco@hotmail.com","addeddate":"2004-05-25 15:53:19","adder":"1fingerwillie","pick":"0","notes":"A digital copy of this White House recording has been provided by the Miller Center of Public Affairs. For more information on this and other recordings, visit the Miller Center's <a href=\"http://www.millercenter.virginia.edu/scripps/index.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">Scripps Library</a>.","source":"Lyndon B. Johnson Presidential Library","taper":"White House","subject":"Lyndon B. Johnson","publisher":"White House","numeric_id":"5421","boxid":"OL100020310","backup_location":"ia903600_5"},"reviews":[{"review_id":"44002","reviewbody":"This tape, which I also had to download from the actual scripps site, is quite interesting. The main conversation is with Governor Moss of Utah who tries to explain to LBJ why he wants a lake conservation bill passed, but LBJ doesnt really like the wording of it, so he's inclined to veto it. The final conversation they have you can tell Moss is clearly annoyed \"I've spent 6 months on this!\". Other people get invited for lunch, and Gerald Ford calls in to talk about a bill and also dismisses Goldwater a bit here too. Pretty good tape!","reviewtitle":"Ford on Ford action","reviewer":"Spuzz","reviewdate":"2005-06-18 22:20:18","createdate":"2005-06-18 22:20:18","stars":"4"}],"server":"ia801301.us.archive.org","uniq":638578947,"workable_servers":["ia801301.us.archive.org","ia601301.us.archive.org"]}